  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitator combi-track agro-logistics Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is (1.) to align the combi-strategy of this track with the vision and practical experiences identified by Kenyan stakeholders, particularly the private sector, and (2.) to generate practical insights and relevant interventions for this track and (3.) improve the business development pipeline. Furthermore, the goal is to (4.) generate tangible results from practical experiences that will inspire other stakeholders to embrace the combi approach. A facilitator will operate as an extension the combi-track team.</narrative>
  </description>
